WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440
Hi, it's Dr. Alex. Your procedure is one week away, so it's a great time to get

2
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.240
a few things in

3
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.720
order. First, pick up your bowel prep kit from the pharmacy if you haven't

4
