back on raw vegetables,

11
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:36.720
whole grains, nuts, and seeds. And lastly, take a moment to review your current

12
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.840
medications.

13
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:42.560
If you take blood thinners, iron supplements, or diabetes medications, we have

14
00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.600
